The grid is a list of 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1, 1, and 1.
Keep a shared distance as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared queue as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared count as 0.
For every cell from 0 to 8.
If item cell of grid is 0, Place 0 into distance, Place cell into queue, add 1 to count.
If item cell of grid is 1, Place 1000000 into distance.

To relax with spot (a whole number) and here (a whole number).
The offered is here plus 1.
If item spot of distance is more than offered, set item spot of distance to offered, Place spot into queue, add 1 to count.

The head is 0.
Repeat while head is less than count.
The cell is item head of queue.
Add 1 to head.
The row is cell divided by 3.
The column is cell modulo 3.
The here is item cell of distance.
If row is more than 0, relax with cell minus 3 and here.
If row is less than 2, relax with cell plus 3 and here.
If column is more than 0, relax with cell minus 1 and here.
If column is less than 2, relax with cell plus 1 and here.

For each value in distance, show value.
